1
00:00:00,597 --> 00:00:03,437
(Sheldon:)except for the snake scene
and the face-melting scene,

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:06,980
(Sheldon:)which I can only watch
when it's still light out, but...

3
00:00:07,137 --> 00:00:10,307
(Sheldon:)I defy you to find a story problem.

4
00:00:10,473 --> 00:00:12,883
Herds my jaw... drop it.

5
00:00:14,711 --> 00:00:15,651
(Amy:)All right.

6
00:00:15,812 --> 00:00:19,222
(Amy:)Indiana Jones plays no role
in the outcome of the story.

7
00:00:19,382 --> 00:00:23,492
(Amy:)If he weren't in the film,
it would tum out exactly the same.

8
00:00:23,653 --> 00:00:27,123
(Sheldon:)Oh, I see your confusion.
You don't understand.

9
00:00:27,290 --> 00:00:30,970
(Sheldon:)Indiana Jones was the one in the hat
with the whip.

10
00:00:31,928 --> 00:00:34,968
(Amy:)No, I do,
and if he weren't in the movie,

11
00:00:35,131 --> 00:00:37,011
(Amy:)the Nazis would have still found
the ark,

12
00:00:37,167 --> 00:00:40,077
(Amy:)taken it to the island,
opened it up and all died,

13
00:00:40,236 --> 00:00:42,346
(Amy:)just like they did.

14
00:00:47,477 --> 00:00:51,027
Let me close that for you.

